## Development Guide

### Adding New Endpoints

1. Define handler in `internal/handlers/`
2. Add route in `internal/server/server.go`
3. Add tests in `tests/`

### Middleware

Echo provides built-in middleware, and custom middleware can be added in `internal/middleware/`.

### Database Migrations

{{- if ne .DatabaseDriver ""}}
```bash
# Create new migration
make migrate-create name=create_new_table

# Run migrations
make migrate-up

# Rollback migrations
make migrate-down
```
{{- end}}

